---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
description: Browse and download The 180-Day Descent.
---
<section class="page-hero wrap wide">
  <p class="eyebrow">Foundations to the 2026 research frontier</p>
  <h1>{{ book.title }}</h1>
  <p class="sub">A 180-day map of knowledge by {{ book.authors }}.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap wide">
  <div class="download-grid">
    <article class="download-card">
      <p class="card-kicker">Read online</p>
      <h2><a href="/days/001-what-is-knowledge/">Start Day 1</a></h2>
      <p>Browse the course as a static website with live, progressively enhanced teaching widgets.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="download-card">
      <p class="card-kicker">Offline</p>
      <h2><a href="{{ book.downloads.epub }}">Download EPUB</a></h2>
      <p>Portable ebook edition with no-JS interactive fallbacks for reader compatibility.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="download-card">
      <p class="card-kicker">Print</p>
      <h2><a href="{{ book.downloads.pdf }}">Download PDF</a></h2>
      <p>6 by 9 inch print edition with static alternatives replacing live controls.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap wide">
  <p class="sec-eyebrow">Available descents</p>
  <div class="toc-grid">
    {% for item in collections.days %}
      {% include "components/day-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

